      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Loan Fundamentals


    Loans aren''t free money. A loan is money you
    borrow that you must pay back, usually with interest (the cost of borrowing the
    money). You''ll have a set repayment schedule, so you need to be sure your business
    can generate enough cash flow to cover the monthly payments.


    Your personal
    finances matter. Even though the loan is for your business, lenders will heavily
    evaluate your personal credit score and financial history to determine your creditworthiness.
    A good credit score and history show you''re responsible with money and can increase
    your chances of approval and getting better loan terms.'
